      <title>单月狂卖7800颗！英特尔桌面CPU份额重回21% 酷睿Ultra销量翻倍</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/chiptech/post/20260910/%E5%8D%95%E6%9C%88%E7%8B%82%E5%8D%967800%E9%A2%97%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%94%E6%A1%8C%E9%9D%A2CPU%E4%BB%BD%E9%A2%9D%E9%87%8D%E5%9B%9E21-%E9%85%B7%E7%9D%BFUltra%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F%E7%BF%BB%E5%80%8D/</link>
